#: main.cpp:121
msgid ""
"<h1>Configuring GOFAI</h1>"
"<h2>Data view</h2>"
"<br><b>Maximum items:</b> shows how many items can be in the view at once. "
"Setting it to a convenient level may help to keep the visual image at a "
"manageable complexity. At the same time, you should be avare that for a low "
"value some of the immediate neighbors may fall out of the view."
"<h2>Look & Feel</h2>"
"<br><b>Base font size:</b> Shows the relative size of the fonts. The fonts "
"will be scaled anyhow with the size of the window and the distance from the "
"center "
"<br><b>Colors:</b> Sets the colors of the different widgets and the links "
"with negative or positive weight."
"<br><b>Animation:</b> Animated navigation. Turn it of on slow machines"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konfigurering van Gofai</h1>"
"<h2>Data besigtig</h2>"
"<br><b>Maksimum iteme:</b> vertoon hoe veel iteme kan wees in die besigtig "
"na as eers. Opset dit na 'n gerieflik vlak dalk mag hulp na hou die visuele "
"beeld na 'n handteerbare kompleksiteit. na die selfde tyd, jy moet wees "
"bewus wat vir 'n lae waarde sommige van die onmiddelik bure dalk mag val uit "
"van die besigtig."
"<h2>Kyk & Gevoel</h2>"
"<br><b>Basis skrif tipe grootte:</b> vertoon die relatiewe grootte van die "
"skriftipes. die skriftipes sal wees skaleer in elk geval met die grootte van "
"die venster en die afstand van die sentrum "
"<br><b>Kleure:</b> Verstel die Kleure van die ander widgets en die skakel "
"met negatiewe van positiewe gewig."
"<br><b>Animasie:</b> Geanimeerde navigering. Skakel dit van op stadige "
"masjiene"
